 FormBox["\<\"{1, 3*x, (3*(-1 + 5*pow(x, 2)))/2, (5*x*(-3 + 7*pow(x, 2)))/2, \
(15*(1 - 14*pow(x, 2) + 21*pow(x, 4)))/8, (21*x*(5 - 30*pow(x, 2) + 33*pow(x, \
4)))/8, (7*(-5 + 135*pow(x, 2) - 495*pow(x, 4) + 429*pow(x, 6)))/16, \
(9*x*(-35 + 385*pow(x, 2) - 1001*pow(x, 4) + 715*pow(x, 6)))/16, (45*(7 - \
